units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1 1 1
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press vol pe ke etotal density
run 220000
